                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} g^* R = \{h:e\to d | e\in C, g\circ h\in R\}
            (recall that by the stability axiom of Grothendieck topologies,
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi g
                    %mo *
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi d
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ∈
